gious groups. &lt;br /&gt;One or the other. You can&amp;#39;t have it both ways and expect any semblance of equity.&lt;br /&gt; </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5028145124238881094/comments/default/2336523441900076627'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5028145124238881094/comments/default/2336523441900076627'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/07/seek-ye-first-protection-of-property.html?showComment=1468775745636#c2336523441900076627' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/07/seek-ye-first-protection-of-property.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5028145124238881094' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5028145124238881094' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2125503596"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 17, 2016 at 11:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2924913186321308745</id><published>2016-07-17T06:27:07.594-06:00</published><updated>2016-07-17T06:27:07.594-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I think the Church left you William??&#xa;&#xa;Grave yard ...</title><content type='html'>I think the Church left you William??&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Grave yard point cowboy</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5028145124238881094/comments/default/2924913186321308745'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5028145124238881094/comments/default/2924913186321308745'/><link rel='al